  fixed in version 0.0.221

The installer creates a timestamped backup of existing patch files,
DDraw.dll, D3DImm.dll, dgVoodoo.conf, ASYLUM\keys.cfg and ASYLUM\config.dat
under the game's back directory before applying the verified setup. Do not
copy a complete keys.cfg from another installation.

HELP AND BUG REPORTS

Discord #help-and-bug-reports:
https://discord.gg/9tP8qFG7Y

SUPPORT LOG

Every launch automatically creates one compact timestamped file under the
game's logs directory. If a problem occurs, reproduce it once, close the game
and attach the newest deathtrap-native-*.log file to the report. The file
already contains the patch version, relevant display and dgVoodoo settings,
and a low-rate input/cursor summary. No diagnostic setting needs to be enabled.

This patch contains no game assets. It redistributes only the two unmodified
dgVoodoo runtime DLLs required by Deathtrap Dungeon. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES must
remain with redistributed copies of the patch.

